§ `Regulative rule: section 147(1), the qualification within 2 months`

DECLARE `s 147(1) act` IS ONE OF
    `s 147(1) obtain the share qualification`

-- (1): the director must obtain the qualification within 2 months (or the shorter period). The clock counts days; the caller supplies the
-- number of days from appointment to the last day (from `s 147(1) the last day on which the director must have obtained the qualification`).
-- src:11893 | 147.—(1) Without affecting the operation of sections 145 and 146,
-- src:11894 | every director, who is by the constitution required to hold a specified
-- src:11895 | share qualification and who is not already qualified, must obtain his
-- src:11896 | or her qualification within 2 months after his or her appointment or
-- src:11897 | such shorter period as is fixed by the constitution.
@ref s 147(1) (src:11893-11897)
GIVEN `the name of the director` IS A STRING
      `the number of days from the appointment to the last day for obtaining the qualification` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 147(1) act`
`s 147(1) a director must obtain the qualification in time` MEANS
    PARTY Director `the name of the director`
    MUST `s 147(1) obtain the share qualification`
    WITHIN `the number of days from the appointment to the last day for obtaining the qualification`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Director `the name of the director` BECAUSE "the director did not obtain the share qualification within 2 months after appointment or the shorter period the constitution fixes"
